# documentation(Circle)
_Circle {s4.R}_

## A circle

------

*Inherits from `Shape`.*

### Usage

```r
Circle(name, r = 1)
```

### Arguments

|     |     |
| --- | --- |
| `name` | A label for the shape. |
| `r` | The radius. |

