# documentation(area)
_area {s4.R}_

## Area of a shape

------

### Usage

```r
area(shape, ...)
```

### Arguments

|     |     |
| --- | --- |
| `shape` | A shape. |
| `...` | Unused. |

### Value

A number.

### Methods

- `area(<Circle>)`: Area of a circle
- `area(<ANY>)`: Area of anything else

